        "node_id": "n_1_c68bd5",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous solution was that it didn't correctly handle the case where removing an element from the sorted sequence could still form an arithmetic progression. The new approach should check if removing an element from the original sequence can create an arithmetic progression by considering the differences between adjacent elements in the sorted sequence.",
