        "node_id": "n_3_b4a2b3",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of sorting the sequence and checking for arithmetic progressions after removing each element can miss valid solutions. A more robust approach is to consider the differences between adjacent elements in the sorted sequence and check if removing one element can create a valid arithmetic progression. This method should be more reliable for identifying the correct index to remove.",
